Found {{ models|length }} baseline model{{ 's' if models|length > 1 else '' }} for {{ seu_name }}. Active model: version {{ active_version }}, R-squared {{ active_r_squared }}, trained on {{ active_samples }} samples.
{% else %}
{# No models #}
